      "source": [
        "## Interband Absorption Spectrum\n",
        "\n",
        "Decomposition into X-point ($\\mathcal{E}_g^X = 1.94$ eV, saddle onset) and L-point ($\\mathcal{E}_g^L = 2.45$ eV, Fermi edge) contributions at room temperature."
      ]
    },
